      "text": "     --- Formation ---\nAI coding agents with Github copilot | Microsoft – Sr. Dev. Come Redon – 2026 \nROS – Robot Operating System | Bordeaux INP (Y. Mollard) – 2021\nRéglementation Directive Machine | CETIM  – 2021\nMachine Learning – TensorFlow | Ambient IT – 2019\nDataiku | DSS – 2018\nAnalyse d’images | CPE Lyon – 2016\nLicence pro – Gestion de projets innovants | Université de Bordeaux 1 – 2009 🎓\nDUT – Sciences et Génie des Matériaux | Université de Bordeaux 1 – 2008 🎓",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Imyk0rcoECsAJcx7SjUCe",
      "originalText": "     --- Formation ---\nAI coding agents with Github copilot | Microsoft – Sr. Dev. Come Redon – 2026 \nROS – Robot Operating System | Bordeaux INP (Y. Mollard) – 2021\nRéglementation Directive Machine | CETIM  – 2021\nMachine Learning – TensorFlow | Ambient IT – 2019\nDataiku | DSS – 2018\nAnalyse d’images | CPE Lyon – 2016\nLicence pro – Gestion de projets innovants | Université de Bordeaux 1 – 2009 🎓\nDUT – Sciences et Génie des Matériaux | Université de Bordeaux 1 – 2008 🎓",
      "autoResize": true,
